WEBVTT

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:07.412
Open Interaction Center, Management, Lead Statuses.

00:00:07.412 --> 00:00:11.179
Each status has a name, an order, and a type:

00:00:11.179 --> 00:00:13.542
Open, Closed or Converted.

00:00:13.996 --> 00:00:17.451
Leads in an Open status are still worked and loaded.

00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:21.324
Closed means the lead was finished without being converted.

00:00:21.324 --> 00:00:25.376
Converted is the status a lead gets when it becomes a contact.

00:00:25.829 --> 00:00:27.301
Click Add Status.

00:00:27.301 --> 00:00:32.101
Give it a Name and a Description, set the Order, and choose the Type.

00:00:32.101 --> 00:00:36.261
Only an open status can be the one where a new lead starts.

00:00:36.261 --> 00:00:37.349
Click Save.

